OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786353512
OL,3,CAndy Burnham to pledge 'everyday
OL,4,Cfixes' for rising bills on cost of
OL,5,Cliving tour
OL,7,FITV News Political Correspondent Fred
OL,8,FDimbleby explains what we can expect
OL,9,Ffrom Andy Burnham's national cost of
OL,10,Fliving tour and why opposition parties
OL,11,Fremain sceptical
OL,13,FAndy Burnham will pledge to provide
OL,14,F"everyday fixes" for rising bills and
OL,15,Fwill accelerate plans to tackle
OL,16,F"subscription traps" as he kicks of
OL,17,Fhis summer cost of living tour on
OL,18,FMonday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
