PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786353512
OL,3,CAndy Burnham to pledge 'everyday
OL,4,Cfixes' for rising bills on cost of
OL,5,Cliving tour
OL,7,FThe prime minister intends to spend
OL,8,Fmuch of August travelling the country
OL,9,Fasking the public how the government
OL,10,Fcan improve their lives.
OL,12,FBurnham's officials have said he will
OL,13,Fbe in "listening mode", with a focus
OL,14,Fon tackling the cost of living and
OL,15,Fimproving local high streets.
OL,26,@uD@GOUuD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786353512
OL,3,CAndy Burnham to pledge 'everyday
OL,4,Cfixes' for rising bills on cost of
OL,5,Cliving tour
OL,7,FThe PM is expected to announce a
OL,8,Fseries of "everyday fixes" to reduce
OL,9,Fcosts, promising to "pull every single
OL,10,Flever we can to provide people with
OL,11,Fsome room to breathe on the cost of
OL,12,Fliving".
OL,14,FOn Monday, he will accelerate plans to
OL,15,Ftackle "subscription traps" by
OL,16,Frequiring companies to make it easier
OL,17,Fto cancel subscriptions and provide
OL,18,Fmore information about costs up-front
OL,19,Frather than quietly auto-renewing them
OL,20,Fat a higher price.
OL,26,@pD@KOUpD@ZO]qD@UOUtD@GO]wD@HOUwD@[O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786353512
OL,3,CAndy Burnham to pledge 'everyday
OL,4,Cfixes' for rising bills on cost of
OL,5,Cliving tour
OL,7,FThe changes, announced by Keir
OL,8,FStarmer's previous government in
OL,9,FApril, had been expected to come into
OL,10,Fforce next spring, but Burnham will
OL,11,Fbring their introduction forward to
OL,12,FJanuary.
OL,14,FHe will also launch a consultation on
OL,15,Fadding deceptive discount offers to
OL,16,Fthe Competition and Markets
OL,17,FAuthority's list of banned practices.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786353512
OL,3,CAndy Burnham to pledge 'everyday
OL,4,Cfixes' for rising bills on cost of
OL,5,Cliving tour
OL,7,FThis would make it easier for the
OL,8,Fwatchdog to punish firms that engage
OL,9,Fin practices such as artificially
OL,10,Finflating prices and then immediately
OL,11,Foffering a "discount" to make a
OL,12,Fproduct look much better value than it
OL,13,Fis.
OL,15,F"I know people are sick and tired of
OL,16,Frip-off discounts and subscription
OL,17,Ftraps," Burnham said. "Westminster has
OL,18,Fgot used to telling people that
OL,19,Feveryday hassles like this are just
OL,20,Fpart of life.
OL,26,@sD@LOUsD@UO]wD@AOUyD@GO]yD@WOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786353512
OL,3,CAndy Burnham to pledge 'everyday
OL,4,Cfixes' for rising bills on cost of
OL,5,Cliving tour
OL,7,F"I don't think that's right,
OL,8,Fespecially when the cost of living
OL,9,Fcontinues to weigh heavily on so many
OL,10,Fpeople's lives."
OL,12,FDame Clare Moriarty, chief executive
OL,13,Fof Citizens Advice, welcomed the
OL,14,Fproposals, saying subscription traps
OL,15,Fand deceptive discounts were "a
OL,16,Fwidespread problem".
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@PO]wD@^OUxD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786353512
OL,3,CAndy Burnham to pledge 'everyday
OL,4,Cfixes' for rising bills on cost of
OL,5,Cliving tour
OL,7,FCitizens Advice has previously found
OL,8,F26% of UK adults had accidentally
OL,9,Ftaken out a subscription in a single
OL,10,Fyear, with the government saying its
OL,11,Faction on subscriptions could save
OL,12,Fhouseholds #14 per month.
OL,14,FFurther announcements are expected
OL,15,Fover the summer, with the prime
OL,16,Fminister describing Monday's proposals
OL,17,Fas "just the start".
OL,26,@yD@DOUyD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/12
