CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786353512
OL,3,CAndy Burnham to pledge 'everyday
OL,4,Cfixes' for rising bills on cost of
OL,5,Cliving tour
OL,7,FOpposition figures have criticised
OL,8,FBurnham's August plans as a "vanity
OL,9,Ftour" offering only "tinkering" of
OL,10,Fpolicy, while urging him to implement
OL,11,Fbroader tax cuts.
OL,13,FBurnham's summer tour follows his
OL,14,Fpledge on his first day in office to
OL,15,Fgive the public "breathing space" on
OL,16,Fbills.
OL,26,@pD@]OUqD@EO]qD@UOUqD@_O]wD@QOUwD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
