CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786353512
OL,3,CAndy Burnham to pledge 'everyday
OL,4,Cfixes' for rising bills on cost of
OL,5,Cliving tour
OL,7,FIn his first week in Downing Street,
OL,8,Fhe announced cuts to VAT on household
OL,9,Fenergy bills and a #2 cap on bus fares
OL,10,Fas immediate measures to tackle the
OL,11,Fcost of living.
OL,13,FBut rising costs remain a major issue
OL,14,Ffor the public as the fallout from the
OL,15,FIran war keeps inflation higher than
OL,16,Fexpected
OL,18,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,19,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,20,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,21,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/12
