OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786353512
OL,3,CAndy Burnham to pledge 'everyday
OL,4,Cfixes' for rising bills on cost of
OL,5,Cliving tour
OL,7,FShadow chancellor Sir Mel Stride said:
OL,8,F"Andy Burnham has already run out of
OL,9,Fideas.
OL,11,F"The cost of living didn't become a
OL,12,Fproblem last week, so you have to ask
OL,13,Fwhy it has taken Labour so long to
OL,14,Fenact legislation passed by the
OL,15,Fprevious government.
OL,17,F"Labour's tax hikes have sent costs
OL,18,Fsoaring for hardworking families and
OL,19,Fdestroyed jobs. Consultations and
OL,20,Freheated measures won't make up for
OL,21,Fthat."
OL,26,@pD@AOUsD@AOUyD@AOU}D@FO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786353512
OL,3,CAndy Burnham to pledge 'everyday
OL,4,Cfixes' for rising bills on cost of
OL,5,Cliving tour
OL,7,FLib Dem Treasury spokeswoman Daisy
OL,8,FCooper said: "We Liberal Democrats
OL,9,Fhave long called for stronger consumer
OL,10,Fprotections and we want to see the
OL,11,FGovernment go further.
OL,13,F"If the new PM is serious about this,
OL,14,Fhe should introduce strengthened
OL,15,Fprotections against rogue traders,
OL,16,Fmake energy bills fairer by giving
OL,17,Feveryone a discount on their essential
OL,18,Fusage, and clamp down on the big
OL,19,Fsupermarkets' unfair shrinkflation
OL,20,Ftactics.
OL,26,@pD@NOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/12
