OL,3,CAndy Burnham to pledge 'everyday
OL,4,Cfixes' for rising bills on cost of
OL,5,Cliving tour
OL,7,F"With a new PM in place, people up and
OL,8,Fdown the country will expect to see
OL,9,Fbig changes and soon."
